# WS1-09 expectation for 057-gating-matrix.py, written before the run.
# Columns: module, host, hosted-amiga, hosted-amiga-13, freestanding.
# A = accepted, R = rejected with E11200, - = the spec does not say.
# Sources:
# - host: spec/appendix-amiga.md intro ("The host profile has no AmigaOS
#   Intuition and rejects the module with E11200") and appendix-stdlib.md §13,
#   §14 ("the host and freestanding profiles reject it with E11200") for
#   std.amiga.*; the core modules are the host test surface (spec/15 §2).
# - hosted-amiga: v1 ships every module (spec/appendix-amiga.md §1, §1.6).
# - hosted-amiga-13: the KS1.3 subset of spec/appendix-amiga.md (classic
#   Intuition, graphics, DOS delay, VBlank interrupts, custom registers, the
#   classic Exec surface, video/ILBM/sprite/audio/input/timer/text/layers);
#   §1.6 modules and workbench/icon/expansion are 2.0+ and rejected ("Nothing in
#   this appendix makes them part of the 1.3 profile"; "the KS1.3 profile rejects
#   the modules with E11200").
# - freestanding: spec/15-profiles.md §2 (no heap: String/Box rejected; "the
#   embedded std.mem allocator surface is not available"), so std.mem is R and
#   std.amiga.* is R; std.io is the console (A); std.fmt, std.iff, std.math,
#   std.text are not specified (-).
# Unknown profile name: E11201 (spec/15-profiles.md PR-5).

